537	        <article id="features">
538	            <h2>Key Features</h2>
539	            <p>
540	                This template includes semantic HTML elements, responsive design, modern CSS with gradients,
541	                proper meta tags for SEO, and accessibility considerations to create a solid foundation for any web project.
542	            </p>
543	            <ul class="feature-list">
544	                <li>Semantic HTML5 structure</li>
545	                <li>WCAG 2.1 accessibility compliance</li>
546	                <li>Mobile-first responsive design</li>
547	                <li>Keyboard navigation support</li>
548	                <li>Open Graph meta tags</li>
549	            </ul>
550	            <button type="button" class="cta-button" id="learn-more-btn" aria-label="Learn more and contact us">Learn More</button>
551	        </article>
